&lt;h6&gt;（税効果会計関係）&lt;/h6&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 72px; line-height: 16px; text-align: left; text-indent: -12px"&gt;１．繰延税金資産及び繰延税金負債の発生の主な原因別の内訳&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div style="margin-left: 84px"&gt;
&lt;table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" style="table-layout: fixed; width: 526.6px"&gt;
